0A07           1201   ; These are the pins used for the keypad in this program:
0A07           1202   ROW1 EQU P1.2
0A07           1203   ROW2 EQU P1.4
0A07           1204   ROW3 EQU P1.6
0A07           1205   ROw4 EQU P2.0
0A07           1206   COL1 EQU P2.2
