0A3A D294      1254   setb ROW2
0A3C D296      1255   setb ROW3
0A3E D2A0      1256   setb ROW4
0A40           1257   
               1257   $MESSAGE TIP: SW0 is used to control the layout of the keypad. SW0=0: unmodified keypad. SW0=1: keypad rotated 90 deg CCW
